        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakutogolani kpwa sababu chila wakati munanitambukira na kugbwira mafundzo ambago nákufundzani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nalonda mmanye kukala chitswa, yani mkpwulu wa alume osi ni Jesu, chitswa cha mchetu ni mlumewe, na chitswa cha Jesu ni Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mlume yeyesi avoyaye ama kutabiri kuno akadzifwinika chitswa, anaaibisha chitswache, yani Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye mchetu avoyaye ama kulavya unabii wakati atu akakutana kpwa mavoyo bila ya kudzifwinika chitswa, anaibisha chitswache, yani mlumewe. Mana hinyo ni waibu sawa na mchetu kunyolwa chiphala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:4–5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mana yanjina ni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Phahi mlume yeyesi ambaye ana nyere nyire, achivoya ama kutabiri, anaaibisha chitswache, yani Jesu.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Naye mchetu ambaye kana nyere nyire, achivoya ama kulavya unabii wakati atu akakutana kpwa mavoyo, anaibisha chitswache, yani mlumewe. Mana hinyo ni waibu sawa na mchetu kunyolwa chitswa chizima.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ichikala kamendze kudzifwinika chitswa, baha anyolwe. Ela ichikala ni waibu mchetu kuphunguzwa ama kunyolwa nyere, phahi naadzifwinike chitswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
